ing in with tag team  partners would better 096's chances of  taking the lizard down however due to  scp-096's shyness and tendency to kill  everyone and everything that looks at  him he doesn't have many friends looking  to volunteer 9 tails said 096 will cry  in the corner while 682 starts attacking  it eventually it gets confused that 096  isn't fighting back after an hour and  begins to adapt to it and becomes docile  forever okay look while it's unlikely  that this would happen it's certainly  nice to imagine isn't it adam britton  said narratively it needs to conclude  with a reason to never try it again so  i'm going to say that 682 will  telepathically project the image of 096  into the site staff or the entire human  psychospace  yikes  this is a possibility so terrifying and  honestly plausible that it's making us  regret wanting to see this rematch all  together chaos insurgency said i think  682 would just think for damn sake just  leave me alone given he's been through  more termination attempts than scp 5031  can count on its fingers who could blame  him for getting a little frustrated  michael porter said i think that 682 and  096 would take each other to court for  aggravated assault against the other  either one of them will get sentenced to  death and will unsurprisingly not die or  the two team up to kill the entire  courtroom and they walk out as a new  serial killing team the real question is  what kind of lawyers would represent a  pair of murderous anomalous monsters in  court better call saul ari workman said  maybe if we try being nice to them for  once we can offer them a cup of tea and  get them both a therapist 682 will talk  all his hate away and then realize his  wrongdoing and become an activist and  096 would become very confident about  his face and become a model there  problem solved hey when people strive  towards self-improvement we're all  winners but we don't know if we can stay  the same for 682-096  even if this rematch ever 